# parameter.config
#
# FLAG per-student cho bai dso-iac-scan.
#
# Co che chong bypass:
#   - Token literal IACGATEFLAG duoc dat trong file /opt/gate/flag.env TREN CONTAINER `ci`
#     (sinh vien KHONG co shell tren ci -> khong the cat/doc truc tiep).
#   - Luc parameterize, framework thay IACGATEFLAG bang mot hash 16 ky tu, sinh tu
#     LAB_MASTER_SEED (dso-iac-scan_ptit_seed) + email sinh vien -> moi SV mot flag khac nhau.
#   - Dich vu gate tren ci chi DOC va TRA VE gia tri nay khi tu quet tfsec dat 0 HIGH/CRITICAL.
#   - Khi cham, goals so sanh gia tri sinh vien luu o ~/flag.txt (tren devsecops) voi
#     parameter.iacflag (= dung hash tren) bang string_equal.
#
# Cu phap: <param> : HASH_REPLACE : <container>:<file> : <TOKEN> : <seed_string> : <len>

iacflag : HASH_REPLACE : ci:/opt/gate/flag.env : IACGATEFLAG : dso_iac_scan_flag_seed : 16
